.claude/settings.local.json

# AC-105 local credential handoff (mode 0600, removed on shutdown)
.foundry/

# AC-119 — evidence must survive a fresh clone (F-134).
#
# `*.log` and `test-results/` above are correct for build noise, but they
# also silently swallowed retained evidence twice: `PV1-043` recorded that
# Finding 6 had "no reproduction record at all" because `test-results/` is
# ignored, and at AC-103 the diagnosis logs were dropped from a `git add`
# for the same reason and had to be renamed to `.txt` to be retained.
#
# Evidence a gitignore rule can quietly discard is not retained evidence.
# These negations make `docs/evidence/` exempt, so an artifact placed there
# is committed or visibly refused -- never silently absent.
!docs/evidence/**/*.log
!docs/evidence/**/logs/
!docs/evidence/**/test-results/
